# Harness Rules Index

按需加载 `rules/` 下的规则文件。不要一次加载全部。

## 路由表

| 用户在做什么 | 加载规则 |
|-------------|----------|
| 改 backend 分层、import 方向、BE-001 | `rules/architecture-boundaries.mdc` + `rules/fastify-layer-discipline.mdc` |
| 新增/改 Fastify route 或 JSON Schema | `rules/api-design.mdc` |
| 改 backend 错误处理、异常映射 | `rules/error-handling.mdc` |
| 改 React 组件、hooks、前端 API 调用 | `rules/react-vite-frontend.mdc` |
| 写/改测试 | `rules/testing-tdd.mdc` |
| 范围蔓延、抽象过早、功能膨胀 | `rules/anti-overengineering.mdc` |
| 幻觉 API、Ghost Layer、假编译通过 | `rules/llm-anti-patterns.mdc` |
| PR / VALIDATE→REVIEW 架构审查 | `rules/pr-review-architecture.mdc` |

## PEV 阶段默认规则

| 阶段 | 建议加载 |
|------|----------|
| DECOMPOSE / PLAN | `anti-overengineering.mdc` |
| IMPLEMENT (backend) | `architecture-boundaries.mdc`, `fastify-layer-discipline.mdc`, `api-design.mdc` |
| IMPLEMENT (frontend) | `react-vite-frontend.mdc` |
| VALIDATE | `testing-tdd.mdc` |
| REVIEW | `pr-review-architecture.mdc`, `llm-anti-patterns.mdc` |

